 "notes": "Other hosted decision endpoints, mostly known from OpenRouter listings. Liquid d1 (POST https://api.liquid.ai/decisions/v1/systemone; text and images on paid d1, d1:free text-only; remote image URLs not accepted; 65,536 context). Upstage Solar Decide (beta; choice takes 2 to 26 options because it reads single-token labels A-Z, 27+ returns 422; 524,288 context; Korean strength). Inception Mercury Decide (free OpenRouter route, 32,768 context; no first-party docs found). Respan Span-01 (behavior scorer: present / absent / not_observable probability per behavior; a native not-observable class; marketed for AI traces). Together Tev1 4B (NOT a probability endpoint: chat completions return a single option letter, 2-24 labeled options, temperature 0, max_tokens 8). Kev 4B on SiliconFlow via OpenRouter (8,192 context). meraGPT Decider 1 (hosted; 4,096-token requests and Choice limited to ten labels per the awesome list, primary docs unreadable). Unknowns stay null.",
